.SH BUGS
The locale manipulation functions are minimal.
Signal functions and terminal characteristic
handlers are only minimally implemented.
.IR Link
always fails, because Plan 9 doesn't support multiple links to a file.
The functions related to setting effective user and group ids
cannot be implemented because the concept doesn't exist in Plan 9.
.PP
No thread is preempted: one that spins on a variable another thread sets,
with no call that waits and no
.IR sched_yield ,
never lets that thread run, and hangs.
Each stdio stream has a lock, taken by every stdio call and by
.IR flockfile ;
the
.I getc
and
.I putc
macros take it only when the buffer is empty or full.
A program with threads cannot
.IR fork ;
.I posix_spawn
works.
